From a133f22f313b5d3c685c1620d31aa3f63340d6bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GCSA-aegis <aegis@gcsa.local>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 17:24:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Aegis: add phishing interstitial for built-in seed hosts

Show a Lookalike/Insecure-Form style warning on main-frame navigations
that match the Aegis phishing seed list, gated by module prefs.
